# Direct dependencies of Policy Q&A RAG v2 (Day 13).
# Compile the lock file with:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in -c constraints/day12-v1-environment.txt -o requirements.txt
# The constraints file is Day 12's exact environment (uv pip freeze), so every package
# shared with RAG v1 keeps the same version and the v1 baseline behaves identically.

